@atomiks because the format is locale sensitive.
You can setup formats like `P` (which is even the default) that will use different formats depending on the locale `MM/DD/YYYY` in enUS, `DD/MM/YYYY` in frFR, etc... 
So you need the JSX to be derived from the format provided to the component (which is also what React Arias and MUI X do).

